    ('<ec-icon name="ship" /> Sea LCL</th><td>1 m³ = 1,000 kg (W/M)</td><td>Charged per revenue tonne: whichever is greater, cubic metres or tonnes.</td>', '<ec-icon name="ship" /> Zee LCL</th><td>1 m³ = 1.000 kg (W/M)</td><td>Berekend per vrachtton: kubieke meters of tonnen, wat het hoogst is.</td>'),
